{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"80973","synopsis":"After Sonobe is mysteriously attacked a murder takes place in Sayoko's home. Leading us further into the questions: What are the Blade Children and is Sayoko really a Blade Child?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301558.jpg"},{"title":"Cursed Children","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"80974","synopsis":"Eyes Rutherford has skyrocketed to the pinnacle of success but Eyes holds a dark secret one that could take him down with it. What does Eyes know and how does he know Kiyotaka??","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301559.jpg"},{"title":"The Happiness of Those Who Believe","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"80975","synopsis":"Sonobe has wound up dead! Now Ayumu and Hiyono are determined to dig up some dirt on this crime. While searching for the killer they meet the ever cocky Kousuke. There's more to this guy than Ayumu knows: Kousuke is a Blade Child! And if things didn't seem weirder he also knows Kiyotaka!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301560.jpg"},{"title":"Misty Gallows","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"80976","synopsis":"The mystery of the Blade Children continues. Mr. Imazato informs Ayumu about the Blade Children. But before he can reveal anything a mysterious person takes away his life. The Blade Children refuse to let anyone stand in the way of their mysterious destiny. The only person that is the key to their salvation is Ayumu.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301561.jpg"},{"title":"Blind Spot in the Web","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"80978","synopsis":"The mystery of Imazato's murder gets underway. However there's a hidden danger as Hiyono becomes the next target of the Blade Children. Can Ayumu protect Hiyono from certain death? All this and more.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301562.jpg"},{"title":"The Choice of the Nonbeliever","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"80977","synopsis":"Ayumu has been issued yet another challenge by the Blade Children. A challenge that could most definitely be Ayumu's greatest and deadliest one yet. Meanwhile at the police station Madoka tries to get in to Kiyotaka's file but instead learns that there's a chance that Adachi, Sonobe, and Imazato possibly have something to do with Kiyotaka's mysterious disappearance. Who were these three really and can Ayumu and Hiyono actually defeat the Blade Children once and for all?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301563.jpg"},{"title":"Day of the Defeated","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"80980","synopsis":"After leaving Hiyono in the hands of the Blade Children, Ayumu begins to wonder if all these dangerous games really are worth the chance of Hiyono getting killed. Madoka remembers her promise to Kiyotaka: To always be there for Ayumu no matter what. After which Ayumu returns to the hospital for the chance to save Hiyono. What will Ayumu suggest?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301564.jpg"},{"title":"All Things That Are Possible To You","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"80979","synopsis":"After losing to Rio last time Ayumu makes a comeback. Since each side has something the others want Hiyono and the tape another game is devised. This time by none other than Ayumu. After the game begins Rio rushes off to catch up to Hiyono while Kousuke heads off to intercept the damning tape. When Rio pushes Hiyono onto a train it now seems like certain death for Ayumu. With a bomb around his neck and Hiyono on a moving train however will Ayumu get out of this alive!?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301565.jpg"},{"title":"Only One Wise Action","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"80981","synopsis":"The game is underway but the victor is still unknown. As Kousuke rushes to intercept the damning tape from Ayumu's control Rio decides to meet Ayumu face to face to see the game to the end.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301566.jpg"},{"title":"Goodnight Sweetheart","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"80982","synopsis":"Ayumu has finally won the battle. Rio confesses a few things. Once she gets back to the hospital Eyes offers Ayumu a deal.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301567.jpg"},{"title":"Dry Eyes","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"80983","synopsis":"It's Christmas time and the Blade Children receive an ominous warning: The Hunters are coming! Eyes seeks help from an old friend and sends a word of caution to Ayumu. Who are the Hunters and the Blade Children and who are friends and who are foes?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301568.jpg"},{"title":"Overture","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"80984","synopsis":"A Hunter has come to assassinate the Blade Children. Eyes, Ayumu and Kousuke become partners. Ayumu might help to save the mysterious leader of the Blade Children. Can they unravel the mysterious assassins' plot before it's too late?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301569.jpg"},{"title":"Shimmering Fragrance","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"80985","synopsis":"Ayumu's got a day off from school which gives him enough time to try and piece together the mystery of the Blade Children. With extreme reluctance Ayumu is intrigued with the recent events leading up to the Blade Children. As they go back through the school year  the story of Spiral begins to come closer together.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301570.jpg"},{"title":"Like A Swan","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"80986","synopsis":"The Hunters grow more and more desperate to annihilate the Blade Children. As if that wasn't all, a high stakes game pits an old friend of Eyes' and Eyes himself against each other. Rutherford prepares to strengthen his defenses against the Hunters.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301571.jpg"},{"title":"Moving Targets","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"80987","synopsis":"A transfer student comes to the Academy and much to the dismay of Ayumu, it's Kousuke. But it's all forgotten when Ayumu discovers Hiyono and Rio have been kidnapped by the Hunters. Now, it's up to Ayumu, Kousuke, and Ryoko to save them","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301572.jpg"},{"title":"The Watcher in the Darkness","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"80988","synopsis":"Ayumu, Ryoko, and Kousuke enter the abandoned hospital where Hiyono and Rio are being held. But the Hunters have traps set up on each and every floor. Will this trio save the girls before it's too late?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301573.jpg"},{"title":"The Lamenting Angel","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"80990","synopsis":"Rio and Hiyono are safe for now after the kidnapping. After which all seems well until Kanone shows up in Japan, which is a surprise to Ayumu. Before Ayumu can soak in the consequences of Kanone's arrival, Sayoko becomes more involved than ever.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301574.jpg"},{"title":"Mirror of the Heart","episodeNumber":19,"sourceEpisodeNumber":19,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"80989","synopsis":"A Hunter has his eyes set on a different target: Sayoko! Can Ayumu and Eyes save Sayoko, and disarm the bomb in time before the Blade Children suffer an agonizing defeat?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301575.jpg"},{"title":"Whispering Shadows","episodeNumber":20,"sourceEpisodeNumber":20,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"80991","synopsis":"Kousuke makes the dumbest decision of his life: taking on a Hunter face to face. Will Kousuke be killed or can he be saved by Ayumu?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79059/301576.jpg"},{"title":"The Sound of a Breaking Heart","episodeNumber":21,"sourceEpisodeNumber":21,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"245","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"341","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79059","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"80992","synopsis":"Ayumu must face his most powerful enemy yet; someone he'd least suspect! The Blade Children plan an attack against the Hunters. And Madoka has encountered someone from the past, who's got intentions that are far worse than death.","thumb